import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 420 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Law-Precedence Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 420 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Law-Precedence Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation","no":420,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Law Precedence","Realm Inflation","Comparison","Setting Self-Consistency"],"related":["09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance","97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0420_模块2-莽荒纪-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免境界膨胀.md","filePath":"en/0420_模块2-莽荒纪-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免境界膨胀.md"}'),o={name:"en/0420_模块2-莽荒纪-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免境界膨胀.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,d){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-420-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-law-precedence-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-realm-inflation" tabindex="-1">Entry 420 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Law-Precedence Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-420-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-law-precedence-comparison-how-heng-yuan-zhou-avoids-realm-inflation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 420 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Law-Precedence Comparison: How Heng Yuan Zhou Avoids Realm Inflation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 25) | Benchmark base: Documents 09, 97, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-dares-expand-while-manghuang-collapses-at-the-first-expansion" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why Heng Yuan Zhou dares expand while Manghuang collapses at the first expansion <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-heng-yuan-zhou-dares-expand-while-manghuang-collapses-at-the-first-expansion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why Heng Yuan Zhou dares expand while Manghuang collapses at the first expansion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> is this entry&#39;s core — law precedes, never retcons, setting self-consistency above plot convenience. Manghuang&#39;s sixteen realms inflated to collapse; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-plus-two stably expands. The difference is not &quot;dare to be big,&quot; but &quot;legislate first or follow plot to change first.&quot; This entry directly compares the two approaches. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: Manghuang = high-leaning-medium, Heng Yuan Zhou = extremely low. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy waste when law does not precede: every time Manghuang inflates, early setting must be overturned and retold; both author&#39;s and reader&#39;s trust consumed. Heng Yuan Zhou law-precedes; new dimensions all join as appendix; early iron rules not a character changed — <strong>expansion does not depreciate old trust; this is true expansion.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How law-not-preceding manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Rules swing with plot</strong>: in Manghuang whoever plot needs wins; rules have no authority</li><li><strong>Old setting overturned</strong>: every expansion is a historical negation</li><li><strong>Knowledge cannot accumulate</strong>: rules unstable; last generation&#39;s experience may be invalid for the next</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind law-not-preceding is the author&#39;s monopoly of &quot;rule-defining right&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Manghuang</strong>: rules follow the protagonist&#39;s appetite; defining right in author/protagonist hands</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou</strong>: rules legislated first; defining right in law&#39;s hands; even the author cannot casually change</li><li><strong>Core</strong>: law precedence is taking defining right from &quot;the storyteller&quot; back to &quot;the law&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Changes Rules With Plot</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Law Precedes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Realms added as desired</td><td>Nine realms fixed; new dimensions via appendix</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough conditions swing with plot</td><td>Each realm&#39;s promotion conditions legislated first</td></tr><tr><td>Early iron rules late invalidated</td><td>Early iron rules not a character changed</td></tr><tr><td>Author can overturn setting</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table verifies first</td></tr><tr><td>Whoever plot needs wins</td><td>Strength 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15 exam</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: compare &quot;Manghuang changes rules with plot&quot; vs. &quot;Heng Yuan Zhou law precedes&quot; two worldviews&#39; evolution</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: continuously inject ten &quot;needs new realm&quot; plot pressures</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: early-iron-rule survival rate, rule-conflict points, reader trust</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under the change-with-plot model iron-rule survival rate declines each round; under the law-precede model after ten expansions iron-rule survival rate still above 90%</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Manghuang self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Rules swing with plot</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou self-consistency: high</strong>. Law precedes; rules recomputable</li><li><strong>Manghuang retcon-ending risk: high</strong></li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: Manghuang high-leaning-medium vs. Heng Yuan Zhou extremely low</strong></li></ul><p>Law precedence also means one thing: the author cannot stand above his own setting. Manghuang&#39;s biggest problem is not many realms, but the author can change anytime. Heng Yuan Zhou writes law above everyone — including the author; new dimensions can only join by appendix caliber. This looks like chaining the story, but is actually insuring the worldview. Rules the author can overturn anytime are, to readers, equal to no rules; only rules even the author cannot casually change deserve to be called law.</p><p>Law precedence also means setting is not the author&#39;s private property. Manghuang treats setting as play-dough; Heng Yuan Zhou treats setting as constitution. Play-dough can be kneaded freely; amending the constitution goes through procedure. This seemingly rigid procedure is precisely why the worldview survives.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: expansion does not depreciate old trust; expansion is accumulation, not negation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: take rule-defining right from author/protagonist back to law</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system has a ceiling but does not legislate; Heng Yuan Zhou even legislates the ceiling</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: law precedence means Myriad Ranks promote by the same rules; no one exception</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: this is precisely the institutional guarantee of &quot;can infinitely expand without collapsing&quot;</li></ul><p>Law precedence also brings an unexpected benefit: it lets the author boldly write big. Manghuang&#39;s author is actually trapped by his own inflation — the bigger he writes, the less he can close. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s framework nailed down first; the author can instead expand boldly, because new dimensions have appendix caliber to catch them. Law precedence does not restrict creation, but underwrites creation. True freedom is freedom within a fixed framework.</p><p>Law precedence is not rigidity, but responsibility. Responsible to readers, responsible to setting, responsible to future expansion. A world that can change anytime is irresponsible to everyone.</p><p>This is also the most profound lesson the law-first axiom leaves on Manghuang.</p><p>Rules&#39; dignity is the worldview&#39;s dignity.</p><p>This is what the law-first axiom ultimately guards.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou dares expand not because it is bigger, but because it first nailed rules down. Manghuang collapses at first expansion not because it is too small, but because it never established rules from the start. Law precedence, plain and simple, is one sentence — first nail the law dead, then let the story run within the law; reverse it, and however big the story it is only a sand tower.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · law-precedence comparison · how Heng Yuan Zhou avoids realm inflation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./419_模块2-莽荒纪-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与种族歧视.html">Entry 419 · Myriad-Races Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./415_模块2-莽荒纪-境界体系替代-九境+二境的稳定框架.html">Entry 415 · Realm-System Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const p=n(o,[["render",s]]);export{c as __pageData,p as default};
